4b-753abd1fb977": "The bag is very nice, good quality material and carefully finished. I've bought from you several times, including presents for family and friends, and they've gone down a treat every time!", "cc89eb48-a7a1-474e-8759-eab022f0c127": "Very, very nice and excellent quality.", "a02767af-78e7-445c-89ea-27b39c2fc6fd": "This is my third bag already and I'm delighted with it.", "ccf5c7d3-346b-4939-ab09-cdaff4193bb9": "This is already the second bag I've ordered – exactly the same design and the same colour – this time as a gift! Highly recommend!", "8860e184-dd14-4708-bc71-88a897280111": "Very nice and good quality, just like in the photos.", "1cfdc99f-6571-4ee4-8fd5-b611694581c1": "I ordered 3 bags: Mia Espresso, Mia Black and Lina Mini Baby Blue, and I'm delighted with all three. All three look even better in person, and the quality is excellent. They're perfect!", "3cd22332-146d-4f24-bfb2-6c066f9b6ab7": "The bag is gorgeous!", "1e9e277c-c83c-4e12-a63c-e6666d346e60": "A gorgeous bag with beautifully finished details! Top quality at a fair price ❤️", "873cc76b-0f6f-465b-924e-6c3b191fad77": "I got a gorgeous bag. But I already knew it would be great, because in 2021 I ordered a wallet that still looks flawless today, and another one in 2022 that I gave as a gift. I love everything I've bought so far.", "3cbcb410-2eb1-4f6c-b1bd-62b5e5926cbc": "I've only had it a short while, but I really like it and so far it feels good quality. I'll probably buy more. It looks just like the photo, and the colour is spot on too. One thing I'd suggest: an inside pocket or a divider, so everything doesn't end up at the bottom of the bag. All my other bags started to look tatty quite quickly, because the material scratched easily or wore with time. They weren't leather, but they were from well-known brands I'd have expected more from.", "f3c6525a-fd18-42c8-9418-f6adae3ff21e": "This is the second bag I've ordered, and I love them both to bits! Beautifully made, with great attention to detail. Thanks so much for being so professional!", "fa96d1ca-da6a-485a-a60e-e0f82a8be5e9": "The bag is simply beautiful!! I love it! Thank you!", "4b231dd5-9a61-4e71-9c34-fea35f03d1ed": "Top quality.", "5c089889-bf30-4940-9c5d-165486e86318": "The bags are beautiful! The packaging, the attention to detail – everything is flawless.", "ec09625b-c22b-4768-9a29-05eedfb534c8": "A gorgeous and very practical bag", "56e814d9-e80f-49c0-b16d-63eb3e557ffa": "The bag is very nice and good quality.", "a2d110c4-c166-4ebf-a273-7fe275eaf3c8": "Gorgeous colour, very nicely made and the ideal size: neither a suitcase nor a purse :) I love that the design is kept simple and clean, with no unnecessary frills. A truly elegant bag! I also bought a Mia in Dark Chocolate and a Mia in Cognac, which I gave as a gift. 5*", "ffb75fce-6ac1-4a58-85b5-de36e767687d": "A gorgeous bag made from quality materials!", "cdc0fda1-600e-451f-b597-5004fc29378c": "Exceptional quality, the workmanship pleasantly surprised me. A gorgeous bag – I've already ordered another one in a new colour. Highly recommend.", "bd0679cb-c996-4c0b-aa82-52b615099c98": "The bag is gorgeous and the size is ideal for me. I chose the Cashmere colour; it's a little greyer than I expected, but still lovely. I've worn it once and already got compliments. I can't wait to order the next colour.", "d08cb3fa-ef1d-4086-95c7-a68c7169859a": "Nicely made, looks just as good in person as in the photo. I went for the personalisation (name engraved inside). I'm delighted with my purchase.", "f7baa38f-c947-4735-bdaa-cecc8df45763": "Great material! Perfect size and very practical!", "efbe6407-e366-4e32-afe8-32b6b2c9501a": "A gorgeous bag", "9716e939-1907-4705-8615-99b1cfad2d37": "Really delighted with it! Beautifully made, a lovely elegant design. I already have my eye on two more – so glad I found you! Thank you!", "a97a03b0-bb7c-4622-a39c-04606ab628d4": "An absolutely gorgeous bag. It's roomy, classy and made from very good-quality leather. I really like it.", "9a8795dc-5cf1-47be-8990-2c095870f887": "A very practical and versatile bag! I love the smell of real leather! You can tell it's made with care. Would highly recommend!", "bd9bf2b9-caa8-499a-9cfa-788ab4897abe": "Gorgeous!", "2f26aff4-0ebb-4180-94ee-21fb63725818": "The bag looks perfect! 10/10, highly recommend ❤️", "4fcf25a6-cd87-4c11-892b-504065062096": "I already have this bag in 3 colours – this is the fourth. I love Mihailiuc's products and I've now bought my eighth bag from you.", "4d222d70-da02-4fdf-ae00-f2551f2e04e4": "It's beautiful! I hope I'll get used to the clasp. A nicely structured bag.", "b3c69875-d85d-46f4-9eab-00130fa83971": "Gorgeous!", "c9a99e7a-9a99-49c5-807c-e1ee768031c9": "Lovely and roomy", "fd992fae-f6f9-4fad-aceb-ec0ca02663c0": "Thick, sturdy material, well stitched. The bag is very nice, and the colour is exactly what I was looking for.", "95ae5b82-f0ec-4c75-8225-618372d58758": "Just like in the photo! Very happy!", "d758ff25-ca32-4adf-9e0f-4a1ac510f606": "Very good-quality material, and the bag is very well made! The design is gorgeous, elegant and quite roomy.", "1fafb73f-0035-4edc-a3d3-d4891512fe73": "A gorgeous bag! This is my sixth from you already, and I love it. Hats off to you for the attention to detail and the great work!", "415a3e77-f883-468a-97e3-8a03df3b219b": "This is already my third bag. I love these bags – they're well made, with a lot of attention to detail.", "815754e2-dac7-41e7-940e-d8a94e988c2c": "The bag is gorgeous and very carefully made!", "0c9c2e88-463e-4885-822e-8af09a6bc1e5": "Perfection 🤍.", "f6ca2890-8597-4401-92ea-736776781fb3": "The bag looks very nice, it's good quality, the stitching is perfect and it's quite roomy. It arrived beautifully packed too.", "b73bb8ea-5ff7-4334-8495-19e17c6bdb13": "Great quality! The bag is very nice and goes with lots of outfits.", "b918c975-9a57-4b25-bc2b-cd629e165762": "An extremely practical and roomy bag.", "1ae4efc9-f7c3-4350-b406-9885af0706d5": "It's simply stunning. Roomy, a gorgeous colour, perfect for autumn. Carefully made – I'll love wearing it!", "ab746550-e198-451c-a72a-2038b93b1ae9": "It's gorgeous! Finely stitched, quality leather – I'll be ordering other colours too!", "c4e6355d-f3f1-43e0-8393-37c98d8fc592": "Happy to recommend! 🩷", "99685154-44dc-4655-b4dd-037b32411932": "Fast delivery, and the bag is lovely and very well made. Really delighted. The packaging was a lovely surprise."};</script>
